// 1-8: two short rails over spikes. Pull up off the first, chain two anchors off the second.
id l1-08
name 1-8 LOOSE ENDS
tagline two rails. neither one finishes the job.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main anchor yank
mechanics current:2 pull:1 anchor:2 yank:2
new -
portion 5 swing over current
portion 5 two rails, swing between
portion 5 pull out at the top
hardness 5
